      "value": "I am trying to figure out a nice override setting for outdoor, and it is very difficult to experiment without a group of people, what Gain/Far should be used.  \n\nWe also cannot adjust the frequency graph, which is the main thing that would be nice to have a separate \"outdoor\" setting for, since just Gain/Far will not fix the \"talking into a pillow\" sound you get when outside.",
      "viewerReactions": null
